abstract: >-
  A curated, evidence-based registry of VLA / LLM / Agent harnesses,
  evaluation frameworks, robot benchmarks, runtimes and harness research,
  maintained as both human-readable Markdown and a machine-readable
  YAML registry with timestamped activity metadata.
